---
InheritParentConfig: true
# Catch2's assertion decomposer reads as a chained comparison, and its
# TEST_CASE macros expand to functions with internal complexity. Catch2's
# internal ResultDisposition flags combine enum values the analyzer rejects.
Checks: >
  -bugprone-chained-comparison,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-do-while,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
